   "source": [
    "## Repeating the benchmark with a GPI-warm-started meta-policy\n",
    "\n",
    "`meta_policy_iteration_timed` above always starts its policy-iteration sweep from\n",
    "`meta_policy[s] = 0` for every state -- an arbitrary, uninformed starting guess. Since\n",
    "exact policy iteration converges to the *same* fixed point regardless of the starting\n",
    "policy, a better starting guess can only change *how many sweeps* it takes, never the\n",
    "answer. The obvious better guess is plain GPI: initialize\n",
    "`meta_policy[s] = argmax_j psi_j(s, pi_j(s)) . w` -- a one-shot table lookup against the\n",
    "already-trained `Pi_corners`, no environment queries at all -- instead of `0`."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 30,
   "id": "b478d6184e21",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
